# SABOTAGE: SIDEBAR-REACHABILITY (2026-10-10) — the phase-module nav groups themselves.
# Removes the six X1-gated phase groups (Documents · Chat · Discover · Insights · Calendar · AI)
# from `Samen.UI.Nav.module_nav/1`, restoring the exact defect they were added to close: every
# mount phase's surface (Files/`/files`, Chat, Search, own-org analytics, the `.ics` export, the
# AI plane) is a real shipped page reachable ONLY by hand-typing its URL — a total nav island,
# the PP-8/PP-9 class multiplied by six. The paths (and the host's `*_path` labels) are
# untouched, so this isolates the RENDERING guarantee: labels present, groups gone, tests flip.
# The pre-existing ERP/Banking/Work/Workspace groups and the `surfaces` filter stay intact, so a
# sabotage that broke every group would prove nothing.
# (The hunk must not begin by deleting a blank line — see the note in patch 173.)
