# `@automation_path` label leg, shifting this block; the six groups deleted, their intent and
# the MUST_FAIL target are unchanged.
# RE-ANCHORED (2026-10-19, WS-Notes Phase 3): the Documents group gained the `:pages_path`-gated
# Pages item, so the anchor moved AND the group is now wider. The defect is unchanged: the whole
# Documents group goes, so Files AND Pages become islands, and the MUST_FAIL target is the same.
# Pages rides the SAME `*_path` label the router sets, so the rendering guarantee is untouched.
# The context is WIDENED to the Marketing group above: a deletion-only hunk whose leading context
# also occurs immediately before the surviving Workspace group reverse-applies cleanly, which the
# residue preflight correctly reports as "this sabotage is applied". The longer anchor removes
# that ambiguity without changing a single removed line.
